<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>
    <!--
    Goa'uld System Lord generation-time names.

    The leader PawnKind name maker is parsed through NameTriple.FromString.
    Each rule therefore emits a complete formal identity: a personal Goa'uld
    name, the same value as the explicit nickname, and a throne-house byname.
    Diplomatic interfaces show the formal two-part identity while short pawn
    labels retain the personal Goa'uld name.
    -->
